      {
        "id": 224151,
        "name": "doppelgangerung",
        "username": "doppelgangerung",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/doppelgangerung/{size}/1876_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-11-15T22:00:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Chilly Steke\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Chilly Steke:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>OMG with incapacitated Termi-nation Bunker, Luminary will be unstoppable…</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Combined with Visionary’s Brain Burn or Idealist’s Monster of Id, and Writhe’s Lies of the Shadows, it can do some frightening things…</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Not to mention F5 Tachyon’s blitz - get her a damage buff or two, and throw all her burst cards in the trash, and soon you’re talking about some real damage…</p>",
        "post_number": 33,
        "post_type": 1,
