      {
        "id": 224153,
        "name": "robertmaxfreeman",
        "username": "robertmaxfreeman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/robertmaxfreeman/{size}/2147_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-11-23T17:56:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Chilly Steke\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Chilly Steke:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>OMG with incapacitated Termi-nation Bunker, Luminary will be unstoppable…</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>HOLY CRAP!</p>\n<p>In a similar vein:</p>\n<p>La Commadora: have incapacitated Bunker put someone’s deck into their trash. Then La Commadora puts any card in their trash on top of their deck (wait, under the top card? What happens if a person’s deck is empty?)</p>\n<p>In any case, any ‘take a card/equipment from their trash and draw it/put it on top of their deck’ effect, combined with incapacitated Termi-nation Bunker, let’s you draw any card from your deck!</p>\n<p>I’ll have to think on this further. Thank you Chilly Steke!</p>",
        "post_number": 35,
